	(text "J4 1x10: D7/PA7, D17/PC3, D19/PC5, D38/A20/PF4, D39/A21/PF5.\nJ5 1x12: D22-D24/A0-A2 (PD0-PD2), D31-D33/A9-A11 (PE1-PE3).\nGND between signal pins.\nESD: TVS at the header pin, 220R in series to the MCU\n(limits clamp current into the AVR pin, R x 30 pF = 7 ns)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 179.07 0)
